{"path":"content/maidraid/maidraid_ev1004_02","commands":[{"class":"NaniSummary","line":0,"fields":{"Text":""},"loc":{"Text":{"ko":"메이드장에게 매일 수영복을 입히는 건 포기하기로 했다. 그 대신...","en":"I decided to give up on making the Head Maid wear a swimsuit every day. Instead...","ja":"メイド長に毎日水着を着せるのは諦めることにした。その代わり……","zh-Hans":"我决定放弃让女仆长每天穿泳装的打算。作为交换……","zh-Hant":"我決定放棄讓女僕長每天穿泳裝的想法。取而代之的是……","th":"ผมตัดสินใจยอมแพ้เรื่องที่จะให้หัวหน้าเมดใส่ชุดว่ายน้ำทุกวัน แต่ทว่า...","es":"Decidí renunciar a obligar a la Jefa de Maids a llevar traje de baño todos los días. En su lugar..."}}},{"class":"Wait","line":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"1"}},{"class":"CharacterCloneCommand","line":3,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ma1","Origin":"maid_novice_201"}},{"class":"CharacterCloneCommand","line":4,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ma2","Origin":"maid_novice_201"}},{"class":"AuthorCommand","line":5,"fields":{"CharacterId":"ma1","AuthorLabel":"","AuthorAlias":""},"loc":{"AuthorLabel":{"ko":"메이드 A","en":"Maid A","ja":"メイドA","zh-Hans":"女仆A","zh-Hant":"女僕A","th":"เมด A","es":"Maid A"},"AuthorAlias":{"ko":"파노티콘","en":"Panoticon","ja":"パノプチコン","zh-Hans":"潘诺普蒂空","zh-Hant":"潘諾普蒂空","th":"พานอปติคอน","es":"Panopticon"}}},{"class":"AuthorCommand","line":6,"fields":{"CharacterId":"ma2","AuthorLabel":"","AuthorAlias":""},"loc":{"AuthorLabel":{"ko":"메이드 B","en":"Maid B","ja":"メイドB","zh-Hans":"女仆B","zh-Hant":"女僕B","th":"เมด B","es":"Maid B"},"AuthorAlias":{"ko":"파노티콘","en":"Panoticon","ja":"パノプチコン","zh-Hans":"潘诺普蒂空","zh-Hant":"潘諾普蒂空","th":"พานอปติคอน","es":"Panopticon"}}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":8,"fields":{"ActorIds":"*"}},{"class":"ModifyBackground","line":9,"fields":{"Duration":"0.5","AppearanceAndTransition":"BG_Sand_Beach_None","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":10,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.anger","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterJumpCommand","line":11,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini","Wait":"false","Power":"4","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":12,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini","Wait":"false","Destination":",50,25","EasingTypeName":"EaseOutBack","Duration":"0.3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":13,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.2"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":14,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"manageress_bikini.depressed2","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterStiffCommand","line":15,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini","Wait":"false","Power":"0.2","Duration":"0.1","Count":"2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":16,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"manageress_bikini","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"큭...! 하아, 하아...","texts":{"en":"Kh...! Haah, haah...","ja":"くっ……！ はぁ、はぁ……","zh-Hans":"呃……！哈啊，哈啊……","zh-Hant":"唔……！哈啊，哈啊……","th":"อึก...! แฮ่ก, แฮ่ก...","es":"¡Kj...! Haah, haah..."},"author":"manageress_bikini"},{"class":"ProcessInput","line":17,"fields":{"InputEnabled":"false"}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":18,"fields":{}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":19,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini","Wait":"false","Destination":",47","Duration":"3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":20,"fields":{"Offset":"0,-0.1,0","Zoom":"0.02","Duration":"0.3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":21,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0,0","Zoom":"0.04","Duration":"0.3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":22,"fields":{"Offset":"0,-0.1,0","Zoom":"0.06","Duration":"0.3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":23,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0,0","Zoom":"0.08","Duration":"0.3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":24,"fields":{"Offset":"0,-0.1,0","Zoom":"0.1","Duration":"0.3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":25,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0,0","Zoom":"0.12","Duration":"0.3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":26,"fields":{"Offset":"0,-0.1,0","Zoom":"0.14","Duration":"0.3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":27,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0,0","Zoom":"0.16","Duration":"0.3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":28,"fields":{"Offset":"0,-0.1,0","Zoom":"0.18","Duration":"0.3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":29,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0,0","Zoom":"0.2","Duration":"0.3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":30,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.5"}},{"class":"ProcessInput","line":31,"fields":{"InputEnabled":"true"}},{"class":"PlayBgm","line":32,"fields":{"BgmPath":"bgm_story_004","FadeInDuration":"2","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":33,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"어때, 이제 좀 365일 24시간 수영복을 입고 싶은 생각이 드냐?","texts":{"en":"How about it? Do you feel like wearing a swimsuit 24/7, 365 days a year now?","ja":"どうだ、これで365日24時間水着を着て過ごす気になったか？","zh-Hans":"怎么样，现在有没有点想一年365天24小时都穿泳装的念头了？","zh-Hant":"怎麼樣？現在有沒有產生一年365天、一天24小時都想穿著泳裝的念頭了？","th":"เป็นไง เริ่มอยากใส่ชุดว่ายน้ำตลอด 24 ชั่วโมง 365 วันขึ้นมารึยัง?","es":"¿Y bien? ¿Te han entrado ganas de llevar traje de baño las 24 horas del día, los 365 días del año?"},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":34,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"manageress_bikini.chaos","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":35,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.sad","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":35,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"manageress_bikini","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"아무리 주인님의 명령이라도... 그것만큼은 절대 안 돼요...","texts":{"en":"Even if it's your command, Master... I absolutely cannot do that...","ja":"いくらご主人様の命令でも……それだけは絶対ダメです……","zh-Hans":"就算是主人您的命令……唯独这件事绝对不行……","zh-Hant":"就算這是主人您的命令……唯獨這件事絕對不行……","th":"ต่อให้เป็นคำสั่งของนายท่าน... แต่เรื่องนั้นยอมไม่ได้จริงๆ ค่ะ...","es":"Por mucho que sea una orden del amo... por ahí sí que no paso..."},"author":"manageress_bikini"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":36,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.serious","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":36,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"manageress_bikini","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"저는 메이드장이니까... 메이드복을 입는 건 당연한 거예요.","texts":{"en":"I am the Head Maid... It's only natural for me to wear a maid uniform.","ja":"私はメイド長なんですから……メイド服を着るのは当然のことなんです。","zh-Hans":"我是女仆长……穿女仆装是理所当然的。","zh-Hant":"我可是女僕長……穿女僕裝是理所當然的事。","th":"เพราะดิฉันเป็นหัวหน้าเมด... การใส่ชุดเมดจึงเป็นเรื่องที่แน่นอนอยู่แล้วค่ะ","es":"Soy la Jefa de Maids... Lo natural es que lleve mi uniforme de maid."},"author":"manageress_bikini"},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":37,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"manageress_bikini.respond","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":38,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.anger","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":38,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"manageress_bikini","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"그러니까 저는, 절대 물러설 수 없어요...!!","texts":{"en":"That's why I will never back down...!!","ja":"だから私は、絶対に譲れません……！！","zh-Hans":"所以，我绝对不能退让……！！","zh-Hant":"所以我，絕對不能退讓……！！","th":"เพราะฉะนั้น ดิฉันไม่มีวันยอมถอยเด็ดขาดค่ะ...!!","es":"¡Por eso jamás daré mi brazo a torcer...!"},"author":"manageress_bikini"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":39,"fields":{}},{"class":"Wait","line":40,"fields":{"WaitMode":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":41,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"......허.","texts":{"en":"......Huh.","ja":"……はぁ。","zh-Hans":"……呵。","zh-Hant":"……呵。","th":"......เหอะ","es":"......Vaya."},"author":"player"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":42,"fields":{"Wait":"false"}},{"class":"CharacterAppearToRightCommand","line":43,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"claire_swimsuit","LookDirection":"Right","Wait":"false","Destination":"20,47,50","Duration":"0.5","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":44,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"claire_swimsuit","Wait":"false","Power":"-1","Duration":"0.1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":45,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.5"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":46,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":47,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"claire_swimsuit","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"...음. 해결사.","texts":{"en":"...Mmm. Fixer.","ja":"……ん。フィクサー。","zh-Hans":"……嗯。解决师。","zh-Hant":"……嗯，解決師。","th":"...อืม ฟิกเซอร์","es":"...Mm. Fixer."},"author":"claire_swimsuit"},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":48,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"claire_swimsuit","Wait":"false","Destination":"32,47,25.001","Duration":"1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":49,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"claire_swimsuit","Wait":"false","Power":"-1","Duration":"0.3","Count":"3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":50,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.fear","Wait":"false","Destination":"64","Duration":"0.5","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":51,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini","Wait":"false","Power":"-1","Duration":"0.1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":52,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"manageress_bikini.surprise","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":53,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"claire_swimsuit","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"메이드장의 고기는 메이드복인가봐.","texts":{"en":"Looks like the Head Maid's meat is her maid uniform.","ja":"メイド長のお肉は、メイド服みたい。","zh-Hans":"看来女仆长的肉就是女仆装吧。","zh-Hant":"看來女僕長的心頭肉就是女僕裝呢。","th":"เนื้อของหัวหน้าเมดคงจะเป็นชุดเมดสินะ","es":"Parece que el uniforme de maid es la carne de la Jefa de Maids."},"author":"claire_swimsuit"},{"class":"StopBgm","line":54,"fields":{"FadeOutDuration":"1","Wait":"false"}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":55,"fields":{}},{"class":"Wait","line":56,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.2"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":57,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.embarrassed","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":58,"fields":{"ActorIds":"claire_swimsuit"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":59,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"엉?","texts":{"en":"Huh?","ja":"あん？","zh-Hans":"啊？","zh-Hant":"蛤？","th":"หือ?","es":"¿Eh?"},"author":"player"},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":60,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":61,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"manageress_bikini","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"......네?","texts":{"en":"......What?","ja":"……え？","zh-Hans":"……诶？","zh-Hant":"……啊？","th":"......คะ?","es":"......¿Cómo?"},"author":"manageress_bikini"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":62,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"claire_swimsuit.closeeye","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":62,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"claire_swimsuit","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"그러니까 이번에는 네가 봐주면 안 돼?","texts":{"en":"So could you let it go this time?","ja":"だから今回は、貴方が見逃してあげなよ。","zh-Hans":"所以这次你能不能放过她？","zh-Hant":"所以這次你能不能放過她？","th":"เพราะงั้น ครั้งนี้ยอมๆ ให้หน่อยไม่ได้เหรอ?","es":"Así que ¿podrías dejarlo pasar esta vez?"},"author":"claire_swimsuit"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":63,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"claire_swimsuit.serious","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":63,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"claire_swimsuit","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"고기를 뺏는 건 나쁜 짓이잖아.","texts":{"en":"Taking away someone's meat is a bad thing to do.","ja":"お肉を奪うのは悪いことだから。","zh-Hans":"抢走别人的肉可是坏事。","zh-Hant":"搶走別人的肉可是壞事喔。","th":"การแย่งเนื้อไปมันเป็นเรื่องไม่ดีนี่นา","es":"Quitarle la carne a alguien está feo."},"author":"claire_swimsuit"},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":64,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"manageress_bikini.silence","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":65,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.default","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":65,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"manageress_bikini","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"클레어 님...","texts":{"en":"Claire...","ja":"クレア様……","zh-Hans":"克莱尔大人……","zh-Hant":"克萊爾大人……","th":"คุณแคลร์...","es":"Claire..."},"author":"manageress_bikini"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":66,"fields":{}},{"class":"Wait","line":67,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.5"}},{"class":"PlaySfx","line":68,"fields":{"SfxPath":"SE_Sigh_01","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"0","FadeInDuration":"0.0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":69,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.1"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":70,"fields":{"Offset":",-0.2","Duration":"0.2","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":71,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.22"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":72,"fields":{"Offset":",0","Duration":"0.2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":73,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.5"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":74,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"...하아, 그래. 알았다 알았어.","texts":{"en":"...Sigh, fine. Alright, alright.","ja":"……はぁ、分かった、分かったよ。","zh-Hans":"……唉，行吧。知道了知道了。","zh-Hant":"……哈啊，好吧。知道了知道了。","th":"...เฮ้อ เอาเถอะ รู้แล้วๆ","es":"...Uf, vale. Está bien, está bien."},"author":"player"},{"class":"PrintText","line":75,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"저렇게까지 말하는데 억지로 시키고 싶지도 않고.","texts":{"en":"I don't want to force it when she goes that far anyway.","ja":"そこまで言われたら、無理強いする気も起きないしな。","zh-Hans":"她都说到那个份上了，我也不想强迫她。","zh-Hant":"既然妳都說到這個份上了，我也不想強迫她。","th":"พูดขนาดนั้นแล้วก็ไม่ได้อยากจะบังคับหรอก","es":"Si se pone así, tampoco quiero obligarla."},"author":"player"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":76,"fields":{}},{"class":"Wait","line":77,"fields":{"WaitMode":"1"}},{"class":"PlayBgm","line":78,"fields":{"BgmPath":"bgm_story_022","FadeInDuration":"2","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"1"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":79,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"manageress_bikini.twinkle","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":80,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.smile","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":81,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"claire_swimsuit.smile2","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":81,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"claire_swimsuit","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"응. 고마워.","texts":{"en":"Yeah. Thanks.","ja":"うん。ありがとう。","zh-Hans":"嗯。谢谢。","zh-Hant":"嗯，謝謝你。","th":"อืม ขอบใจนะ","es":"Sí. Gracias."},"author":"claire_swimsuit"},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":82,"fields":{"ActorIds":"claire_swimsuit"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":83,"fields":{"Offset":"-4,1","Zoom":"0.5","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":84,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"그나저나 의외네. 네가 그런 말을 할 줄이야.","texts":{"en":"By the way, that's surprising. I didn't expect you to say something like that.","ja":"それにしても意外だな。お前がそんなこと言うなんて。","zh-Hans":"不过还挺意外的。真没想到你会说出这种话。","zh-Hant":"不過還真意外呢，沒想到妳會說這種話。","th":"แต่ว่าเหนือคาดจริง พูดอะไรแบบนี้เป็นกับเขาด้วยเหรอ","es":"Por cierto, qué sorpresa. No me esperaba que dijeras algo así."},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":85,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"claire_swimsuit.question","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":86,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"claire_swimsuit.default","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":87,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"그동안 메이드장이랑 꽤 친해졌나 본데.","texts":{"en":"Looks like you've gotten pretty close to the Head Maid.","ja":"その間に、メイド長と結構仲良くなったみたいだな。","zh-Hans":"看来这段时间你跟女仆长关系处得不错嘛。","zh-Hant":"這陣子看來妳跟女僕長變得挺親近的嘛。","th":"ดูเหมือนช่วงนี้จะสนิทกับหัวหน้าเมดขึ้นเยอะเลยนะ","es":"Se ve que te has hecho bastante amiga de la Jefa de Maids todo este tiempo."},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":88,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"claire_swimsuit.closeeye","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":88,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"claire_swimsuit","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"응. 전에 한번 상담한 적이 있어서.","texts":{"en":"Yeah. She gave me advice once before.","ja":"うん。前に相談に乗ってもらったから。","zh-Hans":"嗯。之前找她咨询过一次。","zh-Hant":"嗯。之前有找她商量過事情。","th":"อืม เคยปรึกษาเธอเมื่อวันก่อนน่ะ","es":"Sí. Es que una vez le pedí consejo."},"author":"claire_swimsuit"},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":89,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"manageress_bikini.surprise","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":90,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"claire_swimsuit.unique01","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":90,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","Wait":"false","AuthorId":"claire_swimsuit","RevealSpeed":"1.0","WaitForInput":"0"},"text":"그때 메이드장이―","texts":{"en":"Back then, the Head Maid—","ja":"その時、メイド長が――","zh-Hans":"当时女仆长——","zh-Hant":"那時候女僕長——","th":"ตอนนั้นหัวหน้าเมด―","es":"Aquella vez, la Jefa de Maids..."},"author":"claire_swimsuit"},{"class":"ParametrizeGeneric","line":90,"inline":2,"fields":{"Wait":"false","SkipWaitingInput":"true"}},{"class":"Wait","line":90,"inline":3,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.5"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":91,"fields":{"ActorIds":"*"}},{"class":"Await","line":92,"fields":{}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":93,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.happy","Wait":"false","Destination":"48,,24","Duration":"0.3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":94,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini","Wait":"false","Power":"-1","Duration":"0.1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":95,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"claire_swimsuit.surprised","Wait":"false","Destination":"28","Duration":"0.1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":96,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"claire_swimsuit","Wait":"false","Power":"-1","Duration":"0.1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":97,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"manageress_bikini.sweat3","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":98,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"claire_swimsuit.surprise","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":99,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"manageress_bikini","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"크, 클레어 님! 도, 도와주셔서 고맙습니다!","texts":{"en":"Cl-Claire! Th-Thank you for helping me!","ja":"く、クレア様！ た、助けていただきありがとうございます！","zh-Hans":"克、克莱尔大人！谢、谢谢您的帮忙！","zh-Hant":"克、克萊爾大人！謝、謝謝您幫我解圍！","th":"คุณ... คุณแคลร์! ขอบ... ขอบคุณที่ช่วยนะคะ!","es":"¡C-Claire! ¡G-Gracias por ayudarme!"},"author":"manageress_bikini"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":100,"fields":{}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":101,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.sad","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":102,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.5"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":103,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"claire_swimsuit.question","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":104,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"claire_swimsuit.default","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":105,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.5"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":106,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.closeeye","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":107,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":108,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"manageress_bikini.sigh","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":109,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.5"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":110,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.smile","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":110,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"manageress_bikini","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"그리고... 주인님도 이해해 주셔서 감사합니다.","texts":{"en":"And... Master, thank you for understanding as well.","ja":"それに……ご主人様も、ご理解いただきありがとうございます。","zh-Hans":"还有……也感谢主人您的理解。","zh-Hant":"還有……主人，也非常感謝您的體諒。","th":"แล้วก็... นายท่าน ขอบคุณที่เข้าใจนะคะ","es":"Y... amo, gracias a usted también por comprenderlo."},"author":"manageress_bikini"},{"class":"PrintText","line":111,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"됐어, 뭐. 반쯤은 장난이기도 했고.","texts":{"en":"Whatever. Half of it was a joke anyway.","ja":"いいってことだ。半分くらいは冗談だったしな。","zh-Hans":"算了。本来一半也是在开玩笑。","zh-Hant":"算了吧，反正一半也是開玩笑的。","th":"ช่างเถอะน่า ยังไงก็ล้อเล่นไปครึ่งหนึ่งอยู่แล้ว","es":"Da igual. De todos modos, en parte era una broma."},"author":"player"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":112,"fields":{}},{"class":"Wait","line":113,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.5"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":114,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.sad","Wait":"false","Destination":"33,,15","Duration":"3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":115,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini","Wait":"false","Power":"-1","Duration":"0.5","Count":"5","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":116,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.5"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":117,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"manageress_bikini.shy","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":118,"fields":{"WaitMode":"1.5"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":119,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"claire_swimsuit","Wait":"false","Destination":"20,,35","Duration":"0.5","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":120,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"claire_swimsuit","Wait":"false","Power":"-1","Duration":"0.1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":121,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"claire_swimsuit.question","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":122,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.5"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":123,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.shy","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":124,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.5"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":125,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":126,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"manageress_bikini","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"......저어.","texts":{"en":"......Um.","ja":"……あの。","zh-Hans":"……那个。","zh-Hant":"……那個。","th":"......เอ่อ","es":"......Esto..."},"author":"manageress_bikini"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":127,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.sad","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":127,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"manageress_bikini","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"그, 대신이라고 하긴 뭐하지만...","texts":{"en":"Th-This might not be much of a substitute, but...","ja":"そ、その代わりと言ってはなんですが……","zh-Hans":"这、虽然说不上是补偿……","zh-Hant":"雖然，這麼說不太算是補償……","th":"คือ... คือว่า ถึงจะทดแทนกันไม่ได้ก็เถอะ...","es":"E-Esto, no sé si servirá de compensación, pero..."},"author":"manageress_bikini"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":128,"fields":{"Wait":"false"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":129,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini","Wait":"false","Destination":",,5","Duration":"1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":130,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini","Wait":"false","Power":"-1","Duration":"0.3","Count":"3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":131,"fields":{"WaitMode":"1"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":132,"fields":{"Offset":"-4,0","Zoom":"0.7","Duration":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":133,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.4"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":134,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.shy","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":135,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":136,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"manageress_bikini","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"나중에... 단둘이 있을 때라면...","texts":{"en":"Later... when it's just the two of us...","ja":"後で……二人きりの時でしたら……","zh-Hans":"等以后……如果是只有我们两个人的时候……","zh-Hant":"以後……如果是只有我們兩個單獨在一起的時候……","th":"ไว้คราวหลัง... เวลาอยู่กันแค่สองคน...","es":"Más tarde... cuando estemos a solas..."},"author":"manageress_bikini"},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":137,"fields":{"Offset":"-4.5,-1","Duration":"0","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":138,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"manageress_bikini","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"그, 그때는 주인님이 원하시는 대로 준비할게요...","texts":{"en":"Th-Then, I'll dress however you want, Master...","ja":"そ、その時は、ご主人様のお望みの格好をご用意しますから……","zh-Hans":"那、到时候，我会按主人您的喜好准备的……","zh-Hant":"那、那時候我會按照主人您希望的樣子去準備的……","th":"ตอน... ตอนนั้นดิฉันจะเตรียมตัวตามที่นายท่านต้องการนะคะ...","es":"E-Entonces me vestiré como usted quiera, amo..."},"author":"manageress_bikini"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":139,"fields":{}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":140,"fields":{"Offset":"-4,-3","Duration":"0.3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":141,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.5"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":142,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"claire_swimsuit.closeeye","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":143,"fields":{"Offset":"-4,1.5","Duration":"0.6","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":144,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.5"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":145,"fields":{"ActorIds":"manageress_bikini"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":146,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"...오?","texts":{"en":"...Oh?","ja":"……ほう？","zh-Hans":"……哦？","zh-Hant":"……哦？","th":"...โอ้?","es":"...¿Ah, sí?"},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":147,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"manageress_bikini.shy","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterGreetingCommand","line":148,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.sad","Wait":"false","Power":"-3","Duration":"0.3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":149,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"manageress_bikini","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"대, 대신 단둘일 때만이니까요...!","texts":{"en":"B-But only when we're alone...!","ja":"た、ただし！ 二人きりの時限定ですからね……！","zh-Hans":"不、不过，仅限只有我们两个人的时候……！","zh-Hant":"不、不過僅限只有我們兩個人的時候喔……！","th":"แต่... แต่ว่าเฉพาะตอนอยู่กันแค่สองคนเท่านั้นนะคะ...!","es":"¡P-Pero solo cuando estemos a solas...!"},"author":"manageress_bikini"},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":150,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"claire_swimsuit.sleep","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":151,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"좋아. 그건 그럼 나중에 따로 얘기하자고.","texts":{"en":"Deal. We'll discuss that privately later then.","ja":"よし。その話は後でじっくり聞こうか。","zh-Hans":"好啊。那这件事我们之后再私下详聊。","zh-Hant":"好啊。那這件事我們之後私底下再慢慢聊。","th":"ดีเลย ไว้ค่อยไปคุยรายละเอียดกันทีหลังละกัน","es":"Trato hecho. Hablaremos de ello a solas más tarde."},"author":"player"},{"class":"PrintText","line":152,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"난 분명히 아무 말도 안 했다? 네가 직접 말한 거니까?","texts":{"en":"Remember, I didn't say a thing! You came up with that yourself!","ja":"俺は何も言ってないからな？ お前が自分で言ったんだぞ？","zh-Hans":"我可什么都没说啊？是你自己主动提的哦？","zh-Hant":"我可什麼都沒說喔？這可是妳自己提出來的喔？","th":"ฉันยังไม่ได้พูดอะไรสักคำเลยนะ? เธอพูดขึ้นมาเองน้า?","es":"¡Que conste que yo no he dicho nada! ¡Lo has propuesto tú solita!"},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterStiffCommand","line":153,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.shy","Wait":"false","Power":"0.2","Duration":"0.1","Count":"2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":154,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"manageress_bikini.silence","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":155,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"manageress_bikini","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"읏... 네, 네에...","texts":{"en":"Ngh... Y-Yes...","ja":"くっ……は、はい……","zh-Hans":"唔……是、是的……","zh-Hant":"唔……是、是的……","th":"อึก... คะ... ค่ะ...","es":"Uh... S-Sí..."},"author":"manageress_bikini"},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":156,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":157,"fields":{"Offset":"-4,1","Zoom":"0.5","Duration":"3","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":158,"fields":{"Text":"","Wait":"false","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","WaitForInput":"0"},"text":"오케이, 그럼 뭐 대충 이야기도 끝났으니...","texts":{"en":"Okay, so now that our chat is pretty much wrapped up...","ja":"オッケー、じゃあ話もひと段落したことだし……","zh-Hans":"OK，既然事情都谈得差不多了……","zh-Hant":"OK，既然話都說得差不多了……","th":"โอเค ในเมื่อคุยกันรู้เรื่องแล้ว...","es":"Vale, pues como ya hemos acabado de hablar..."},"author":"player"},{"class":"ParametrizeGeneric","line":158,"inline":1,"fields":{"Wait":"false","SkipWaitingInput":"true"}},{"class":"Wait","line":158,"inline":2,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.5"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":158,"inline":3,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress_bikini.sad","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":158,"inline":4,"fields":{"WaitMode":"1"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":158,"inline":5,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"claire_swimsuit.default","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":158,"inline":6,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.2"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":158,"inline":7,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"claire_swimsuit.surprise","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":158,"inline":8,"fields":{"WaitMode":"1.5"}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":158,"inline":9,"fields":{}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":159,"fields":{"Duration":"0","Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"84,,50","IdAndAppearance":"ma1.default","LookDirection":"Left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":160,"fields":{"Duration":"0","Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"95,,50.001","IdAndAppearance":"ma2.default","LookDirection":"Left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":161,"fields":{"Offset":"9,2","Zoom":"0.7","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":162,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.2"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":163,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"자, 이제 복구 작업 시작하자고.","texts":{"en":"Alright, time to start the restoration work.","ja":"さあ、復旧作業を始めるとするか。","zh-Hans":"好，现在开始复建工作吧。","zh-Hant":"來吧，現在開始進行復原工作。","th":"เอาละ มาเริ่มงานบูรณะกันได้แล้ว","es":"Venga, hora de empezar con las tareas de restauración."},"author":"player"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":164,"fields":{}},{"class":"Wait","line":165,"fields":{"WaitMode":"1"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":166,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ma2.embarrassed","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":167,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"ma1.question","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":168,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ma1.embarrassed","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":168,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"ma1","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"......에?","texts":{"en":"......Eh?","ja":"……え？","zh-Hans":"……诶？","zh-Hant":"……欸？","th":"......เอ๊ะ?","es":"......¿Eh?"},"author":"ma1"},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":169,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"ma2.question","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":170,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"ma2","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"...왜 저희를 보고 말씀하시는...","texts":{"en":"...Why are you looking at us when you say that...","ja":"……なんで私達を見ながら言ってるんですか……","zh-Hans":"……您为什么要看着我们说……","zh-Hant":"……為什麼看著我們說這話……","th":"...ทำไมถึงมองพวกเราตอนพูดล่ะคะ...","es":"...¿Por qué dice eso mirándonos a nosotras...?"},"author":"ma2"},{"class":"PrintText","line":171,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"다 같이 일하고 다 같이 놀아야 할 거 아니냐. 그치?","texts":{"en":"We should all work together and play together, right?","ja":"みんなで働いてみんなで遊ぶ、それが筋ってもんだろ。な？","zh-Hans":"大家要一起工作一起玩才对嘛。对吧？","zh-Hant":"大家要一起工作、一起玩樂才對吧。是吧？","th":"ก็ต้องช่วยกันทำงานและเที่ยวเล่นไปด้วยกันสิ ถูกไหม?","es":"Hay que trabajar juntos para luego divertirnos juntos, ¿a que sí?"},"author":"player"},{"class":"Charac